+-- Limits a setup observation to the item and skill phases that a reused setup skips.
+local function setSetupObservation(specEnv, queryObserver, active)
+	if queryObserver and specEnv and specEnv.observeSetup then
+		queryObserver.active = active
+	end
+end
+
+---@class SetupDBWrites
+---@field mods table[] Mods appended in order.
+---@field conditions table<string, any> Conditions set or changed.
+---@field multipliers table<string, any> Multipliers set or changed.
+
+---@class SetupPhaseWrites
+---@field modDB SetupDBWrites
+---@field enemyDB SetupDBWrites
+---@field explodeSources table[]? Explode sources after the item phase.
+
+---@class SetupWrites
+---@field items SetupPhaseWrites?
+---@field skills SetupPhaseWrites?
+---@field unsafe string? Why the captured writes cannot be replayed.
+
+---@class CalcSpecEnv
+---@field env Env? Environment to reuse instead of creating one.
+---@field cachedPlayerDB ModDB?
+---@field cachedEnemyDB ModDB?
+---@field cachedMinionDB ModDB?
+---@field accelerate table<string, boolean>? Setup phases a reused environment skips.
+---@field observeSetup boolean? Record queries only during item and skill setup.
+---@field captureSetup SetupWrites? Receives the direct writes of item and skill setup.
+---@field reuseSetup boolean? Passive-only reuse: copy cached base mods and replay `setupWrites`.
